   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence (10), would best strengthen the writer's response to the safety concern?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A state school safety survey found fewer injuries per hour on supervised climbing walls than on school basketball courts.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Professional climbers often scale indoor walls that are more than fifty feet tall.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-comparison"},{"text":"Climbing harnesses come in many sizes, colors and styles for different users.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Students at Ridley Falls said they enjoyed climbing more than playing volleyball.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A state school safety survey found fewer injuries per hour on supervised climbing walls than on school basketball courts.$q$, $q$The survey compares climbing to a sport the school already offers, which directly answers the claim that climbing is dangerous. The sentence about enjoying climbing supports the first paragraph but does nothing to address safety.$q$, 'draft', 'f54c81d7-40db-5110-8d07-8ec5413721fd')
