   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence 1 to introduce the topic of the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Curling was first played hundreds of years ago on frozen ponds and lakes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-focus-history"},{"text":"Curling is the most exciting winter sport that anyone can watch.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-topic"},{"text":"Many sports are played on ice, including hockey, figure skating and speed skating.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"In curling, a winter sport played on ice, the way teammates sweep in front of a moving stone can decide where that stone stops.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In curling, a winter sport played on ice, the way teammates sweep in front of a moving stone can decide where that stone stops.$q$, $q$The correct sentence names the sport and states the report's focus, the effect of sweeping. The sentence about other ice sports is too broad because the report is only about sweeping in curling.$q$, 'draft', 'cbbbbbcc-5e85-59e4-8c34-7d2987c29364')
