   $q$The report has no concluding statement. Which sentence, added after sentence 15, would best conclude it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Every high school art class should spend at least a month on marbling.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-call-to-action"},{"text":"Size is a liquid thickened with a plant-based powder.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"Their experience showed that marbling, though it uses simple materials, depends on patience and a steady hand to turn floating color into a lasting design.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Next year, Ms. Okafor's class plans to study pottery instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Their experience showed that marbling, though it uses simple materials, depends on patience and a steady hand to turn floating color into a lasting design.$q$, $q$The correct sentence connects the process in paragraphs 2 and 3 to the students' experience in paragraph 4 and states what it teaches. The sentence about pottery moves to a new subject instead of concluding this one.$q$, 'draft', '513ce2d0-73bf-5ff5-8cbd-357fafc7670d')
