  ('fe39df9e-36ca-56df-95b8-c7279ef40999', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g9-informative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Why is it important that the writer defines the word "size" in sentence 4?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The definition shows the writer's opinion that marbling is a difficult craft.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"The definition signals a contrast between old and modern ways of marbling.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"Readers would likely think of the everyday meaning of \"size,\" and the definition prevents confusion when the word appears again in sentence 6.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The word appears only once, so readers can skip it without losing meaning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Readers would likely think of the everyday meaning of "size," and the definition prevents confusion when the word appears again in sentence 6.$q$, $q$"Size" usually means how big something is, so defining it as a thickened liquid keeps readers from being confused, especially when it returns in sentence 6. The claim that it appears only once is false.$q$, 'draft', '513ce2d0-73bf-5ff5-8cbd-357fafc7670d')
