   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence 15, would best conclude the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"By carrying heat out instead of bringing cold in, a refrigerator turns a simple loop of boiling and squeezing into a way to keep food safe for days.","is_correct":true},{"text":"A compressor squeezes the gas into a smaller space.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"People should always check the temperature of their refrigerator every morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-call-to-action"},{"text":"Bacteria are tiny living things that can be found almost everywhere.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$By carrying heat out instead of bringing cold in, a refrigerator turns a simple loop of boiling and squeezing into a way to keep food safe for days.$q$, $q$The correct conclusion returns to the report's main point, that refrigerators move heat out, and ties it to keeping food safe. The sentence about bacteria shifts to a new subject instead of closing the report.$q$, 'draft', '08a08953-92af-50f1-bab5-d03f2a9fb6b4')
