   $q$Which revision of sentence 1 best introduces both the topic and the focus of the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In 2023, the town of Harlow Point launched a bike-share program with 40 bicycles.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"In 2023, the town of Harlow Point launched a bike-share program that everyone should use.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-focus"},{"text":"In 2023, the town of Harlow Point, which sits near a river, launched a bike-share program.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"In 2023, the town of Harlow Point launched a bike-share program, and its first year shows both how popular shared bicycles can be and what challenges they bring.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In 2023, the town of Harlow Point launched a bike-share program, and its first year shows both how popular shared bicycles can be and what challenges they bring.$q$, $q$The correct revision previews the report's two main ideas, popularity (paragraph 3) and problems (paragraph 4). The version with 40 bicycles only repeats a detail from sentence 3 and gives no focus.$q$, 'draft', '5834fe95-45b3-52fd-9fe4-f9ef8f1c1b6c')
