   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (3)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (6)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (11)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-rebuttal"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (6)$q$, $q$Sentence (6) is a personal detail about a cousin's trumpet playing that does not support placing a piano in the station. Sentence (11) must stay because it answers the worry about damage.$q$, 'draft', 'b5feffd2-fb85-56b2-be1b-fa72651b83d9')
