   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (6)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (12)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-rebuttal"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (6)$q$, $q$Sentence (6) shares a personal preference about hiking that does not help show why the hemlocks should be treated. Sentence (4) stays because it explains why the trees matter for the trout.$q$, 'draft', 'df3f57e2-4c90-55ba-8db2-54649a4d7cd1')
