   $q$Read the sentence: "Volunteering at the animal shelter was a ___ that Tomasz did not take for granted." Which choice correctly fills the blank?$q$, $q$[{"text":"privelege","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vowel-swap"},{"text":"privilege","is_correct":true},{"text":"priviledge","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"extra-d"},{"text":"privilage","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vowel-swap"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$privilege$q$, $q$"Privilege" has no d and uses i, i, e, e as its vowels: p, r, i, v, i, l, e, g, e. "Priviledge" adds a d, likely by analogy with words such as "knowledge."$q$, 'draft', null)
