   $q$Read the sentence: "Teachers praised Hamid as a ___ lab partner who double-checked every measurement." Which choice correctly fills the blank?$q$, $q$[{"text":"conscientous","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"missing-vowel"},{"text":"conscientious","is_correct":true},{"text":"consciencious","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"sound-spelling"},{"text":"concientious","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"missing-s"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$conscientious$q$, $q$"Conscientious" is built on "conscience," so it keeps the "sci" and ends in "tious": c, o, n, s, c, i, e, n, t, i, o, u, s. "Consciencious" spells the ending the way it sounds rather than the way it is written.$q$, 'draft', null)
