  ('9ff7fe5a-7e3e-53c7-836d-1e52600abed7', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-grammar-usage'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read the sentence: "The renovated community pool is spacious, well lit, and ___." Which choice completes the sentence with parallel structure?$q$, $q$[{"text":"it costs very little","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"clause-breaks-parallel"},{"text":"with affordability","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"prepositional-breaks-parallel"},{"text":"affordable","is_correct":true},{"text":"has low prices","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"verb-breaks-parallel"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$affordable$q$, $q$The series lists adjectives that describe the pool ("spacious," "well lit"), so the third item should be an adjective: "affordable." "Has low prices" is a verb phrase and does not fit the pattern after "is."$q$, 'draft', null)
