  ('950601e0-969d-50a9-a87c-deeb4b3174ca', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-grammar-usage'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Read the sentence: "The documentary was praised both for its stunning photography and ___." Which choice completes the sentence with parallel structure?$q$, $q$[{"text":"for its clear explanations of glacier science","is_correct":true},{"text":"because it explained glacier science clearly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"clause-breaks-parallel"},{"text":"it explained glacier science clearly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"clause-breaks-parallel"},{"text":"its clear explanations of glacier science","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"missing-preposition-breaks-parallel"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$for its clear explanations of glacier science$q$, $q$"Both" is followed by the prepositional phrase "for its stunning photography," so "and" must be followed by a matching prepositional phrase that starts with "for." Leaving out "for" makes the two halves unequal even though the meaning is close.$q$, 'draft', null)
